---
description: Shared list/table screens with search and pagination
globs: "**/src/{pages,features,components/ui}/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Tables

- Every list screen uses `ResourceTable` from `src/components/ui/ResourceTable.tsx`. Do not invent a second table or list layout. On `md+` it renders a table; below `md` it stacks the same columns as cards.
- Toolbar: search on the left inside the card, optional filters in `toolbarExtra`, **Create** on the top right via `createLabel` + `onCreate` when the resource supports it.
- Pagination matches the backend contract: query `page` (default 1) and `limit` (default 10, max 100). Response `{ data, meta: { page, limit, total, totalPages } }` from `src/lib/pagination.ts`.
- Server-backed lists (divisions) send `page`/`limit` through RTK Query. Do not put list rows in a Redux slice.
- Search and status filters are UI-only until the API adds those params — do not send unknown query keys (Nest `forbidNonWhitelisted` will 400). Filter the current page locally, or use `useLocalTable` for mock data. Known list params (`divisionId`, `categoryId`) may be sent.
- Combine image + title in one primary column (`EntityCell`). Row actions stay in an Actions column and can be icon buttons (`RowActions`) with aria-labels. Create/edit forms use Zod + `useForm` in `src/features/<domain>/`.
- Image cells use `Thumbnail` so hover/focus shows a larger preview.
- Default page size is `DEFAULT_PAGE_SIZE` (10). Previous/Next disable on the first/last page.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — custom list + local slice cache
<ul>{items.map((row) => <li>{row.name}</li>)}</ul>

// ✅ GOOD
<ResourceTable
  title="Divisions"
  searchValue={search}
  onSearchChange={setSearch}
  createLabel="Create division"
  onCreate={openCreate}
  columns={columns}
  rows={data.data}
  meta={data.meta}
  onPageChange={setPage}
/>
```
